  m_text: O? Welcome, o' lost lamb. Lo, this sacred refuge standeth as witness, for
    our faith burneth eternal, and our words have been hearkened unto in the unseen
    realm. Wander forth, if thou must, for thy convictions shall be weighed and thy
    beliefs laid bare. May fortune attend thee, lost lamb.
